@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
title 保持型请求与 2 秒命令持续时间

binary "run_request" as R
binary "run（已提交）" as S
binary "drive" as D

@0
R is low
S is low
D is low

@1
R is high
S is high
D is high

@3
D is low
note bottom of D : 到达截止时间；\n请求仍为 true

@5
R is low
S is low

@6
R is high
S is high
D is high

@8
D is low

D@1 <-> @3 : 2 秒
D@6 <-> @8 : 新的 2 秒
@enduml
